{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Clear MDC when inline restoration fails.** Once an inline executor has settled `result`, this catch ignores an ordinary restoration failure, allowing the caller thread to continue with plugin or durable MDC still attached. Attempt a reliable `MDC.clear()` fallback and surface the cleanup failure if a clean state cannot be established.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77SFL_","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":292,"observation_digest":"f0648d5353683ee9ba439853b9607ede370278d6a8c8ce89a02bdd86ed906f41","observation_id":"aro_v1_6bsi2u2tna7otosdtbj3syd63y","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_oku3igfk3ygjtbpxj7vr4crtuk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2df3d686638d1451d0c62cd2678c16968f3482f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":288,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ootgo3qssiom4dlimlko6anncl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:50:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
